title: Caucus Disunity
subtitle: The Caucus is quarrelling. Restore order before it splits.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_disunity.svg
view-if: disunity_timer <= 0 and (dissent_percent >= 22 or inst_dissent >= 40 or rimward_dissent >= 40 or pacifist_dissent >= 40 or hawk_dissent >= 40)
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; disunity_timer = 2; last_card_timer = "disunity"
new-page: true

= Caucus Disunity

The Caucus is [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]. Institutionalists: [+ inst_dissent : dissent +]. Rimward: [+ rimward_dissent : dissent +]. Pacifists: [+ pacifist_dissent : dissent +]. Hawks: [+ hawk_dissent : dissent +]. A faction whose dissent reaches 60 may leave.

- @discipline: Enforce discipline.
- @concede: Give the angriest faction what it wants.
- @convention: Hold an open convention.
- @easy_discard

@discipline
subtitle: −1 political capital. Everyone calms down a little.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; inst_dissent -= 8; rimward_dissent -= 8; pacifist_dissent -= 8; hawk_dissent -= 8

The whips are out. The Caucus falls into line, grudgingly.

@concede
subtitle: The angriest faction calms down a great deal; the others resent it.
on-arrival: {!
var worst = 'inst', v = -1;
for (var i = 0; i < SW.FACTIONS.length; i++) { var f = SW.FACTIONS[i]; if (Q[f + '_dissent'] > v) { v = Q[f + '_dissent']; worst = f; } }
for (var j = 0; j < SW.FACTIONS.length; j++) { var g = SW.FACTIONS[j]; Q[g + '_dissent'] += (g === worst ? -18 : 4); }
Q[worst + '_strength'] += 3;
Q.conceded_to = SW.FACTION_NAMES[worst];
!}

The Caucus gives the [+ conceded_to +] what they have been demanding. They are mollified. Everyone else takes note.

@convention
subtitle: −2 political capital. Broad relief, and a little more faith.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 2; inst_dissent -= 11; rimward_dissent -= 11; pacifist_dissent -= 11; hawk_dissent -= 11; faith += 0.5

A long, open convention airs every grievance. It is exhausting, and it works.
